{"title":"Menu","markdown":{"yaml":{"toc":false,"format":{"html":{"css":"styles.css"}}},"headingText":"Menu","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<div class=\"background-video-container\">\n  <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>\n    <source src=\"Backgroundrotating.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    Your browser does not support the video tag.\n  </video>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"menu-list\">\n\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Cinnamon Apple Crumble Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 42</span></p>\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Chocolat-y Pecan Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 48</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Pumpkin Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 42</span></p>\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Key Lime Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 45</span></p>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"item\">Rice Krispies Treats</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 22</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"item\">Cornbread</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 22</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"item\">Custom Order</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">on request</span></p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n## How it works\n\n🧁 Every pie is handmade with high-quality Swiss ingredients.<br>\n📏 Size: approx. 24 cm in diameter, serving 6–10 people.<br>\n📍 Pickup in Wallisellen.<br>\n⏰ Please order at least 3 days in advance so everything can be made from scratch. <br>\n💳 Your order is confirmed only after payment is received.<br>\n✉️ Questions? Email me at <a href=\"mailto:hello@flakypieshop.com\">hello@flakypieshop.com</a>.\n\n<button class=\"date-help-button\" type=\"button\"\n        onclick=\"document.getElementById('date-help-modal').style.display='flex'\">\n  Not available on your desired date?\n</button>\n\n<div id=\"date-help-modal\" class=\"date-help-modal-overlay\"\n     onclick=\"if (event.target === this) this.style.display='none'\">\n<div class=\"date-help-modal-content\">\n<button class=\"date-help-modal-close\" type=\"button\"\n            onclick=\"document.getElementById('date-help-modal').style.display='none'\">\n      &times;\n</button>\n<h3>Can't find your perfect date?</h3>\n<p>🧁 I currently bake from <strong>Thursday to Sunday</strong>.</p>\n<p>\n      If the calendar doesn’t show your ideal day, please contact me directly –\n      I can often bake your pie earlier and vacuum seal it for you.\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🥶 Keeps up to <strong>3 days</strong> in the fridge</li>\n<li>❄️ Keeps up to <strong>3 months</strong> in the freezer</li>\n<li>😋 It will be just as delicious afterwards</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n      ✉️ Email me at\n<a href=\"mailto:hello@flakypieshop.com\">hello@flakypieshop.com</a>\n      and we’ll find a solution.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .date-help-button {\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    background: #ce4f81;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-button:hover {\n    opacity: 0.9;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-overlay {\n    display: none; /* shown via JS */\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    z-index: 9999;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-content {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    max-width: 420px;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;\n    border-radius: 1rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-close {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0.7rem;\n    right: 0.7rem;\n    border: none;\n    background: transparent;\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-content ul {\n    padding-left: 1.2rem;\n    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .date-help-modal-content {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<!-- Calendly inline widget begin -->\n<div\n  class=\"calendly-inline-widget\"\n  data-url=\"https://calendly.com/marianna-rosso3/pie-order?text_color=691e42&primary_color=e11979\"\n  style=\"min-width:320px;height:1100px;\">\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js\" async></script>\n<!-- Calendly inline widget end -->\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<div class=\"background-video-container\">\n  <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>\n    <source src=\"Backgroundrotating.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    Your browser does not support the video tag.\n  </video>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spacer-small\"></div>\n\n# Menu\n\n<div class=\"menu-list\">\n\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Cinnamon Apple Crumble Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 42</span></p>\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Chocolat-y Pecan Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 48</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Pumpkin Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 42</span></p>\n  <p><span class=\"item\">Key Lime Pie</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 45</span></p>\n\n\n<p><span class=\"item\">Rice Krispies Treats</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 22</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"item\">Cornbread</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">CHF 22</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"item\">Custom Order</span><span class=\"dots\"></span><span class=\"price\">on request</span></p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n## How it works\n\n🧁 Every pie is handmade with high-quality Swiss ingredients.<br>\n📏 Size: approx. 24 cm in diameter, serving 6–10 people.<br>\n📍 Pickup in Wallisellen.<br>\n⏰ Please order at least 3 days in advance so everything can be made from scratch. <br>\n💳 Your order is confirmed only after payment is received.<br>\n✉️ Questions? Email me at <a href=\"mailto:hello@flakypieshop.com\">hello@flakypieshop.com</a>.\n\n<button class=\"date-help-button\" type=\"button\"\n        onclick=\"document.getElementById('date-help-modal').style.display='flex'\">\n  Not available on your desired date?\n</button>\n\n<div id=\"date-help-modal\" class=\"date-help-modal-overlay\"\n     onclick=\"if (event.target === this) this.style.display='none'\">\n<div class=\"date-help-modal-content\">\n<button class=\"date-help-modal-close\" type=\"button\"\n            onclick=\"document.getElementById('date-help-modal').style.display='none'\">\n      &times;\n</button>\n<h3>Can't find your perfect date?</h3>\n<p>🧁 I currently bake from <strong>Thursday to Sunday</strong>.</p>\n<p>\n      If the calendar doesn’t show your ideal day, please contact me directly –\n      I can often bake your pie earlier and vacuum seal it for you.\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🥶 Keeps up to <strong>3 days</strong> in the fridge</li>\n<li>❄️ Keeps up to <strong>3 months</strong> in the freezer</li>\n<li>😋 It will be just as delicious afterwards</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n      ✉️ Email me at\n<a href=\"mailto:hello@flakypieshop.com\">hello@flakypieshop.com</a>\n      and we’ll find a solution.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .date-help-button {\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    background: #ce4f81;\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-button:hover {\n    opacity: 0.9;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-overlay {\n    display: none; /* shown via JS */\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    z-index: 9999;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-content {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    max-width: 420px;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;\n    border-radius: 1rem;\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-close {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0.7rem;\n    right: 0.7rem;\n    border: none;\n    background: transparent;\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n\n  .date-help-modal-content ul {\n    padding-left: 1.2rem;\n    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .date-help-modal-content {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<!-- Calendly inline widget begin -->\n<div\n  class=\"calendly-inline-widget\"\n  data-url=\"https://calendly.com/marianna-rosso3/pie-order?text_color=691e42&primary_color=e11979\"\n  style=\"min-width:320px;height:1100px;\">\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js\" async></script>\n<!-- Calendly inline widget end -->\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-ext